## Authentication
Unknown (may need login) — Authentication method detected from captured traffic.

### Providing credentials
- Prefer passing auth as request headers or cookies at call time (do not hardcode secrets into the skill).
- If executing via an external proxy/executor, pass per-call credentials (cookies and/or headers) so they are not persisted.

## Dependencies
- Runtime capable of HTTPS requests.
- If using `scripts/api.ts`: TypeScript toolchain (or transpile to JS).

## Endpoints

### Data Read (5)
- `GET /api/v3/ajax/bespoke/public/neu/specs/submenu` — Retrieve submenu specifications.
- `GET /api/v3/ajax/public/guest/favorites/listings-map-ajax` — Retrieve a map of favorited listings.
- `GET /pagead/conversion/{conversionId}/` — Retrieve conversion data by ID.
- `GET /pagead/conversion/{conversionTimestamp}/` — Retrieve conversion data by timestamp.
- `GET /user/` — Retrieve user profile information.

### Data Write (3)
- `POST /api/v3/ajax/bespoke/member/neu/specs/{specId}` — Submit bespoke specifications for a member.
- `POST /interstitial/` — Submit interstitial data (e.g., survey responses).
- `POST /WRSiteInterceptEngine/Targeting.php` — Submit website intercept targeting data.

### Search (2)
- `GET /api/v3/ajax/public/search-generalized-backend-event` — Search using a generalized backend event.
- `POST /api/v3/ajax/public/search/taxonomy/get-category-filter-nodes-all` — Search for category filter nodes.

